    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "アイネスフウジン",
            "enName": "Ines Fujin",
            "jpText": "たしかに！　レースで対決するまでお互い\r\n喋らないで緊張感もっておいたら……\nもっと『勝負』って感じになるかも！",
            "enText": "Hey, yeah! If we avoid speaking to each\nother until our race, the tension will build\nand build… and that'll make our competition\nfeel even fiercer!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 5875797269695796334,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "そうそう！　気持ちから入るってことで。\r\nよーし、じゃあ……スタート！",
            "enText": "Exactly! It's all about starting with the\nright mindset. Ready? Starting… now!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 7734745895884990090,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アイネスフウジン",
            "enName": "Ines Fujin",
            "jpText": "…………。",
            "enText": "……",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -6199821852737358355,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "…………。",
            "enText": "……",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 8524122507467395789,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "…………ふっ。",
            "enText": "<i>…Pfft.</i>",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 4917470489939889908,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アイネスフウジン",
            "enName": "Ines Fujin",
            "jpText": "あははっ！　無理無理！\r\n緊張どころか、おなかムズムズしちゃって！",
            "enText": "Ahahaha! I can't do it! I don't know if it's\ntension or what, but it just feels too weird!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 3598946032391680790,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "あたしたち部屋だって一緒だしね。\r\n四六時中これはちょっと……\nまぁ、いい腹筋運動にはなりそうだけど。",
            "enText": "Right — we <i>do</i> share a room, after all.\nNot saying a single word might be pushing\nit… Though on the other hand, the strain\ncould make for a good ab workout.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -1087343648741087891,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アイネスフウジン",
            "enName": "Ines Fujin",
            "jpText": "ふふっ！　やっぱりあたしたちは――",
            "enText": "Hehe! You know, I think we'll just have to ——",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -2640223314436407281,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "本番のターフに全てを懸ける――！\r\nそれが1番しっくりくるね！",
            "enText": "—— put it all on the table once we step onto\nthe turf! That matches our style the best!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -161629001300350450,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アイネスフウジン",
            "enName": "Ines Fujin",
            "jpText": "負けないよ、ライアンちゃん！",
            "enText": "But I'm going to win it, Ryan!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -302287139140326900,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "捕まえてみせるよ！　アイネス！",
            "enText": "Just try to outrun me, Ines!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -23692503223979010,
            "blockIdx": 11
        }
    ],
